OL,3,GNEWSAMP calls for transparency over
OL,4,Adrone factory
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn MP has called on the government to
OL,7,Fbe "as transparent as they can be"
OL,8,Fabout protection for drone factories in
OL,9,Fthe UK.
OL,11,FIt comes after Russian former deputy
OL,12,Fforeign minister Andrei Fedorov told
OL,13,FBBC Newsnight there might be a
OL,14,F"semi-military" response against UK
OL,15,Fdrone factories by "unknown sources"
OL,16,Fafter the UK government shared
OL,17,Fblueprints for cruise missile
OL,18,Fcomponents with Ukraine.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,380,370,200,160,0,100
