OL,3,GNEWSAMP calls for transparency over
OL,4,Adrone factory
OL,5,
OL,6,FShadow justice secretary Nick Timothy
OL,7,Frepresents Mildenhall which is home to
OL,8,Fa new Ukrainian-owned factory, which
OL,9,Fcan make 1,000 drones a month.
OL,11,FThe Ministry for Defence (MoD) said it
OL,12,Fwould not comment on specific security
OL,13,Fprocedures.
